{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0173_1000_p", "source_sha256": "e691105a2a59e2e0c4479b3e1acc8260e169311120ac8df183adb7c589dc7805", "ja": "（劇場のみんなへの、クリスマスプレゼントを\n買いに来た。次は可奈の分だな……何がいいだろう）", "zh": "（我来买给剧场大家的圣诞礼物了。接下来是可奈的……送什么好呢）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0173_1001_p", "source_sha256": "0507e3bb2ac021e92bd9b35b760b7add1bc9dac8502a4d3b062290a871fee599", "ja": "（あそこの雑貨屋に、可愛い手袋が並んでいるな。\nちょっと見てみるか……ん？）", "zh": "（那边的杂货店里摆着好多可爱的手套啊。要不要去看看……嗯？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0173_1002_036kan", "source_sha256": "49dab0e77150f968cfb91f81544f748f9101519464bc1549dd52916de52dd36f", "ja": "この手袋なら……喜んでくれるかな……？\n…………あれ？", "zh": "这副手套的话……她会喜欢吗……？\n…………咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0173_1003_036kan", "source_sha256": "7f4d49938a05f45946d5c3f99faf9a97169ed08b2a064b34c0f28c81f643619e", "ja": "わわっ！？　{$P$}さん！？\nこ、こんなところでなにしてるんですか？", "zh": "哇哇！？{$P$}先生！？\n你、你怎么会在这种地方？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0173_1004_p", "source_sha256": "90e4516bbb2ae63d4ead82f9f2ed975836a4657080a0b9462104d752bf74faea", "ja": "やっぱり可奈だったか。俺は……ええと、\n次の撮影で使う小物を買いにきたんだよ。", "zh": "果然是可奈啊。我……那个，\n是来买下次拍摄要用的小道具的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0173_1005_036kan", "source_sha256": "5d70134f4d576f5e0689538cc034ddac092f82eb40b762fa3e147ad3df2cbb96", "ja": "そっか～。お休みの日にまでお仕事の買い物だなんて、\nさすが{$P$}さんですね！", "zh": "这样啊～休息日还要买工作上要用的东西，不愧是{$P$}先生呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0173_1006_p", "source_sha256": "0326554c1e3c87fc963699451f41796b133f197883c8879b1a8abc6ff7500c2f", "ja": "そういう可奈こそ、何をしてたんだ？\nあ、もしかして……。", "zh": "正是可奈，你又在做什么呢？\n啊，难道……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0173_1007_036kan", "source_sha256": "0e492dd161c454dc6ca21267c3119433c30cacff5260f47eaf1ab064311c96d0", "ja": "私は、ちょっとプレゼントを……じゃなくてっ！\nお、おいしいケーキ屋さんがあるって聞いて！", "zh": "我本来想买份礼物……不对！\n我、我听说有一家很好吃的蛋糕店！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0173_1008_036kan", "source_sha256": "d04c0dd8b8bbb3dbabf9f8cca14f694275e70949b78b5f0d4b9bcac26812d880", "ja": "それで、自分にクリスマスプレゼントしようかなって！\nさ、最近レッスンがんばってたし、ごほうびですよ～！", "zh": "所以我想着，要不要给自己买份圣诞礼物！\n最、最近一直很努力练习，就当作奖励嘛～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0173_1009_p", "source_sha256": "eb5ac2059400cd3e78e6bda32ac1df7e7787cbf46f30d16ae6c203ed1398bc5f", "ja": "へえ、ケーキか……。でもこの前、最近ちょっと\n食べ過ぎだから、ガマンするって言ってたような……。", "zh": "哦，是蛋糕啊……不过前阵子你不是还说，最近好像吃得有点多，要忍住来着……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0173_1010_036kan", "source_sha256": "94610813d72f516cfd3fee57eecf7ec1ce8cdbca81f63fa8854f9fc88deaf844", "ja": "そ、そんなこと言ったかな～？　ごほうびは別腹～♪\nがんばった可奈～♪　何を食べようかな～♪", "zh": "我、我说过那种话吗～？奖励归奖励，另有一个胃～♪\n努力过的可奈～♪吃点什么好呢～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0173_1011_p", "source_sha256": "754e65da2724e3a550cd856fdbbcaa6d87b3389415cbcb615eb5e4e2e5eaef7a", "ja": "（ケーキ屋さんに行く途中か。その割に、\n熱心に雑貨屋を見てたような気がするけど……）", "zh": "（这是在去蛋糕店的路上吧。可是看她的样子，好像一直在认真看杂货店……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0173_1012_036kan", "source_sha256": "fb21cb7754be3627f6e0a7bb678b47a13b95fc88666e806f6d08d43b04a4af52", "ja": "あの、ところで……{$P$}さんは、\nごほうびをもらえるなら、何がうれしいですか？", "zh": "那个，话说回来……如果能得到奖励的话，{$P$}先生想要什么会开心呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0173_1013_p", "source_sha256": "c5d543349b59e64a04274faf4f9a400d6527c1bfc667bcc56c5c5e6f21cafc41", "ja": "ご褒美？　そうだな……\nやっぱり、普段使えるものだと嬉しいかな。", "zh": "奖励？这个嘛……\n果然还是平时能用上的东西比较开心吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0173_1014_036kan", "source_sha256": "8639c8d1af80dde8b0d5d395d86025bf8c65260b3e6d6466deeb7d229510fed9", "ja": "なるほど～……ふむふむ。\nそれならやっぱり、さっきのがいいかな……。", "zh": "原来如此～……嗯嗯。\n那果然还是刚才那个比较好吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0173_1015_036kan", "source_sha256": "5691cf809e11a7dfa83ae3916a28f1b0096dcf12ede06dce7d44a0e96ebbbd15", "ja": "うん！　あれにしよう～♪　そうしよう～♪", "zh": "嗯！就那个吧～♪就这么办～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0173_1016_p", "source_sha256": "791ad349b73d4e57576041241efc2db84d600685e80441ed9c266d77fb7b9ef7", "ja": "さっきの？　なんの話だ？", "zh": "刚才那个？你在说什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0173_1017_036kan", "source_sha256": "42ea2cd545ad9b23fbd22f9aeb23f12a731aad277df8e9f9c5ada3affe7a6574", "ja": "ななな、なんでもないです！　それじゃあ私、\n行きますね！　{$P$}さん！", "zh": "没没没、什么都没有！那么我，\n先走啦！{$P$}先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0173_1018_036kan", "source_sha256": "65b273fccc89c7392e653476331754f4d49f4e77a863da9cc13b17c46f73294d", "ja": "そぉれ、ケーキ屋さん～♪　いざ行かん～♪\nお買い物は～、そのあと～に～♪　……えへへ。", "zh": "走咯，蛋糕店～♪　出发啦～♪\n买东西嘛～，之后再说～♪　……嘿嘿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0173_1019_p", "source_sha256": "efa17adb8f5478d04c674d468c56377da1895f78e97ca0c5fd8dab7df934bf61", "ja": "（可奈、楽しそうだったな。……さて、\n俺もプレゼントを買いに行こう！）", "zh": "（可奈刚才看起来很开心啊。……好了，我也去买礼物吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
